Message-ID: <125BA7FA-150A-4199-AF4E-F15478A9C117@r-project.org>

Based on the behavior is seems that your custom class is not used. .setenv() is not a valid function in R - there is Sys.setenv() which is presumably what you meant? Also make sure your class is actually on the class path. Some of the code isn't really needed - e.g. you should not manually resize anything - either set the right size in the call to JavaGD() or let the even handling run the resize event.

Cheers,
Simon


